('aggregate-unemployment','wb.SL.UEM.TOTL.ZS','WLD','Aggregate unemployment provides labour-market context.','Whole-economy unemployment combines technology, demand, participation and other influences. Its movement neither identifies nor rules out AI-related displacement.'),
('aggregate-unemployment','fred.PAYEMS','USA','US nonfarm payroll employment averaged about 158.7 million in January–July 2026.','The staging snapshot gives a seven-month mean of 158734.57143 thousand. This is a partial-year average, not an annual total or a counterfactual test of AI employment effects.'),
('aggregate-unemployment','dbn.STATJP.MIm.M.EP.B.TTP.SA','JPN','Japanese employment and unemployment provide a separate national labour-market comparison.','Demography, participation, demand and institutions can affect this series. Japan is not an untreated control for AI exposure.'),
('aggregate-unemployment','fred.LNS14024887','USA','Unemployment among younger workers provides an early-career labour-market indicator.','Age or educational attainment is not direct task exposure. A change cannot be attributed to AI without a comparison design; task productivity evidence does not establish hiring effects.'),
('building','derived.datacentre_capacity_mw','USA','Publicly documented GPU infrastructure provides a partial view of the build-out.','The register has uneven coverage and may include planned systems. Check operational status and dates before reading counts or MW as installed capacity; documentation timing is not necessarily construction timing.'),
('building','epoch.gpu_cluster_count','USA','Publicly documented GPU infrastructure provides a partial view of the build-out.','The register has uneven coverage and may include planned systems. Check operational status and dates before reading counts or MW as installed capacity; documentation timing is not necessarily construction timing.'),
('building','epoch.training_compute_frontier',NULL,'Estimated floating-point operations in the largest documented model-training run.','This is computation performed over a run, not instantaneous electrical power or installed capacity. Hardware efficiency, duration, utilisation and reporting uncertainty affect the connection to electricity demand.'),
('building','fred.A34SNO','USA','New orders for US computers and electronic products, in current dollars.','New orders are a flow, not the backlog of orders awaiting delivery. Comparisons across years are nominal; a matched deflator is required for a volume comparison, and a narrower semiconductor PPI is not that deflator.'),
('building','dbn.EIA.ELEC.GEN.ALL-US-99.M','USA','US electricity generation or commercial-sector sales provide context for power demand.','These aggregates include many uses and do not isolate data centres. AI demand cannot be inferred from their change without customer-level or regional evidence.'),
('building','dbn.EIA.ELEC.SALES.US-COM.M','USA','US electricity generation or commercial-sector sales provide context for power demand.','These aggregates include many uses and do not isolate data centres. AI demand cannot be inferred from their change without customer-level or regional evidence.'),
('building','dbn.BOJ.SPPI.5201450003','JPN','Japanese internet-data-centre service prices.','This is a service-price basket, not a constant-quality price for an AI computation. Read its own dated observations; a flat endpoint comparison does not mean prices never changed.'),
('bulk-discount','dbn.Eurostat.nrg_pc_205.S.6000.MWH_GE150000.KWH.X_TAX.EUR.EU27_2020',NULL,'Electricity prices for the selected non-household consumption band.','Bands classify annual consumption, not factories versus data centres. Prices exclude taxes here. Country and band gaps also reflect contracts, load profiles and aggregation weights; they do not identify a causal bulk-purchase discount or relocation effect.'),
('bulk-discount','dbn.Eurostat.nrg_pc_205.S.6000.MWH20000-69999.KWH.X_TAX.EUR.EU27_2020',NULL,'Electricity prices for the selected non-household consumption band.','Bands classify annual consumption, not factories versus data centres. Prices exclude taxes here. Country and band gaps also reflect contracts, load profiles and aggregation weights; they do not identify a causal bulk-purchase discount or relocation effect.'),
('bulk-discount','fred.DHHNGSP','USA','US Henry Hub natural-gas prices provide one fuel-market comparison.','A US gas benchmark is not the European marginal electricity price or the fuel cost of every data centre. Local generation, network constraints and contracts affect exposure.'),
('bulk-discount','dbn.Eurostat.nrg_pc_205.S.6000.MWH20000-69999.KWH.X_TAX.EUR.DE','DEU','Electricity prices for the selected non-household consumption band.','Bands classify annual consumption, not factories versus data centres. Prices exclude taxes here. Country and band gaps also reflect contracts, load profiles and aggregation weights; they do not identify a causal bulk-purchase discount or relocation effect.'),
('bulk-discount','dbn.Eurostat.nrg_pc_205.S.6000.MWH20000-69999.KWH.X_TAX.EUR.FR','FRA','Electricity prices for the selected non-household consumption band.','Bands classify annual consumption, not factories versus data centres. Prices exclude taxes here. Country and band gaps also reflect contracts, load profiles and aggregation weights; they do not identify a causal bulk-purchase discount or relocation effect.'),
